cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Concord, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Concord: a governed workflow for AI coding agents"
abstract: "Concord keeps people in control of AI coding agents. A strong model plans each change and checks the result, low-cost models implement it inside a fixed file scope, an independent reviewer checks every change at its risk level, and a small dispatcher enforces file scope, tests first, review tiers and attempt caps while recording every verdict with its cause."
